  "pack": "mtt",
  "label": "Tournaments \u00b7 Multi-table",
  "description": "Spot-first studies for multi-table tournaments, organised around effective stack depth rather than treating a tournament hand as a cash hand with one more filter. Nothing here knows the stage of a tournament or what a chip was worth: fpdb stores stacks, blinds and results, not payouts, so no study claims bubble, final-table or ICM context.",
